stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R4ulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R4ulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="3c9fe700-66e9-4bdd-af52-a3b739ab7fb3" class="r-1op2uy0"><div data-rid="6c98e3c7-f21f-4276-980d-cc7dfd758b2b" class="r-1j796ug alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The most important thing to remember when taking Extreme Endurance is to take it consistently like you would a multivitamin. You can split the morning and evening dosage to the time of the day that works best for you. Ex; If you take it at 6 am and 5 pm, we encourage you to try to take it around 6 am and 5 pm everyday. You can take it with or without food.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="ef2db4e2-1272-431a-9309-c79a51d48539" class="r-cg08en" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c820de38-2205-4f55-ae12-f6588d7bfdcb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5elrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1wr4ugp"><div data-rid="948613e6-2223-44e8-9014-020132551a7e" class="r-lgkoui alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What is a “Load Dose”?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c48bb386-cfe6-4158-97de-6210768982e3" class="r-13rin4p"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5elrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R5elrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="06fcee83-b6f3-471d-abd7-9525c879c9a1" class="r-1eiq48g"><div data-rid="9b086c41-5151-4fb9-a819-e9ded760896b" class="r-m23sp3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The normal dose of Extreme Endurance is 6 tablets per day: 3 in the morning and 3 in the evening. For athletes that will be having a significant event or an “extreme” event such as an ultra-distance race, a state meet, or an event that is more intense than your normal events, we recommend what is called a “load dose”. A load dose is taken 7-10 days out from the event and you increase the dosage to 8 tablets per day: 4 in the morning and 4 in the evening and you take 8 tablets for one day after the event and then drop back down to the normal dose of 6 tablets per day. In 2008, our pro-triathletes started using a load dose and they informed us they had their best results bumping up their dosage, so this is why we tell competitors in every sport to use the load dose.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="4705516e-f63b-4e9d-9413-b81ce74fac87" class="r-1lmxwh7" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="e413ccdb-528b-4374-85cf-d546284e72ff" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R5ulrr2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1jj410w"><div data-rid="e9003dd6-c35a-4b05-ac44-e8840597984a" class="r-q0w558 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What sports will benefit from using Extreme Endurance?</p></span></div><div data-rid="32e2ae69-eb79-4881-a8b6-2af52c97170f" class="r-1fonq1x"><span style="display:contents"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="feather feather-chevron-down" style="fill: none;stroke: currentColor;width: var(--rsw, 100%);height: 100%" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span></div></div><div hidden="" id="replo-:R5ulrr2:" aria-controls="replo-:R5ulrr2:" aria-expanded="false"><div data-rid="a5457556-3bfa-4255-a150-b7fefe7815a6" class="r-1vqj177"><div data-rid="9304890e-28a2-459d-9e0f-db45bdaa8683" class="r-1v6ehd8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Since 2008 we have heard from every type of athlete, in every type of sport with the exception of “curling”. We are still waiting for a curler to come forward. So if you are a curler we want to hear from you! Runners, Ultra-distance, Marathon, Triathletes, Crossfit, Cycling, Jiu Jitsu, Swimming, Tennis, Golf, Surfing, Football, Basketball, Baseball, Motorcross, Paddleboarding, Skiing, Boxing, Rugby, Rock Climbing, Wrestling, Hockey - just not curling yet....</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="03626419-d64d-4f6e-a242-dcfc4ba279ea" class="r-5mh8zd"><div class="r-1scwuex" data-rid="1"><div data-rid="65baa3b8-b00a-4872-aa6c-6d6e90045904" class="r-1leahz5"><button data-rid="ab5a2b1b-36e9-4800-ad81-80273a82965a" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-rmysyh alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="16ea34d9-ad11-4d79-a8bf-e9dd5c9d7932" class="r-hikq9x alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Boost my performance</p></span></div></button><picture data-rid="ebc406e5-67f3-478c-91aa-ea5d06ef1794" class="r-1nky1pq"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0574/3450/5404/files/8C8CD7C7-70F2-49BC-AFFF-E21A60F80875.jpg?v=1739989433&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0574/3450/5404/files/8C8CD7C7-70F2-49BC-AFFF-E21A60F80875.jpg?v=1739989433&amp;width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0574/3450/5404/files/8C8CD7C7-70F2-49BC-AFFF-E21A60F80875.jpg?v=1739989433&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0574/3450/5404/files/8C8CD7C7-70F2-49BC-AFFF-E21A60F80875.jpg?v=1739989433" class="r-go6a9p" loading="eager